---
const phone = '02305 544584';
const address = 'Widumerstr. 14, 45768 Castrop-Rauxel';
---

<section id="kontakt" aria-labelledby="kontakt-heading" class="page-grid pt-0">
  <div class="section-card">
    <div class="grid-symmetric gap-10">
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <p class="accent-pill">Kontakt</p>
        <h2 id="kontakt-heading" class="headline text-2xl sm:text-3xl">
          Let&apos;s make it
          <span class="block text-slate-300">a Goodlife Hair Day.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="subheadline">
          Termine am besten per Anruf oder Instagram DM. Sag uns, was du dir vorstellst – wir holen dich dort ab.
        </p>

        <dl class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-200">
          <div>
            <dt class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-slate-400">
              Telefon
            </dt>
            <dd>
              <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="pill-link mt-1 inline-flex">
                {phone}
              </a>
            </dd>
          </div>

          <div>
            <dt class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-slate-400">
              Adresse
            </dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 text-slate-200">
              {address}
            </dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4 text-sm text-slate-200">
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-slate-400">
            Öffnungszeiten
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-slate-200">
            <li>Mo–Fr: 8:30 – 18:30 Uhr</li>
            <li>Sa: 8:30 – 15:00 Uhr</li>
            <li>So: geschlossen</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-slate-400">
            Online Vibes
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-slate-300">
            Die aktuellsten Looks, Color Stories und Einblicke aus dem Salon findest du auf Instagram.
          </p>
          <a
            href="https://www.instagram.com/hairsalon.goodlife"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
            class="pill-link mt-3 inline-flex"
          >
            Zum Instagram-Feed
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

